The [[Galactic Empire]] maintained a '''base''' on [[Ansion]] under the command of [[Admiral]] [[Plor Wiskovis]] of the [[Imperial Navy]]. After [[Lieutenant]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] and [[Ensign]] [[Eli N. Vanto|Eli Vanto]] were suspended, they were sent to the base to await the results of their suspension.<ref name="Thrawn" />

